@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Prototype privacy notice"; }
<section class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Course prototype</p><h1>Use fictional information.</h1></section>
<section class="panel prose"><p>This Part II project is a local classroom prototype. The request form checks input but does not store or send service requests. The dashboard contains fictional sample records.</p><p>Please use made-up names, contact information, and property addresses while testing. No customer account or staff login is available at this stage.</p><p>The application uses temporary cookies for form protection and a generic validation message. Future versions will need database security, role-based access, and an appropriate business privacy policy before handling real customer data.</p></section>
